WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.983
Looking for help? Start with your sector.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.750
Halveron is an imaginary consultancy. Each sector page names a consultant you can talk to.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:20.883
Send a message from the same page, and staff can see which page it came from.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:31.417
People choosing a course, forum members and job seekers use the same 56 pages.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:39.283
All 56 pages began as a prototype, and every address works on the live site.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:44.750
A person is written down once, and every page that names them points there.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.133
Pick a sector, at halveron.junaid.guru.
